@PrintDebateText Text:では魔女裁判を始めます。|#0206Trial02_Yuki001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:まず人間たちの行った罪から<br>説明しますね。|#0206Trial02_Yuki002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:人間はやりすぎました。|#0206Trial02_Yuki003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:彼らはこの世界から、<br>原初の魔女たちを<br>消し去るという<br>蛮行を行った……。|#0206Trial02_Yuki004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.15
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"その行為は身勝手かつ残忍で、<br><link=\"Objection_02_06_02_01\">情状酌量</link>の<br>余地すらありません。|#0206Trial02_Yuki005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.15
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_02_06_02_02\">万死</link>をもっても<br>償いきれるものでは<br>ないんです。|#0206Trial02_Yuki006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……よって、<br>人間を被告とした<br>裁判の判決を言い渡します。|#0206Trial02_Yuki007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.10
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:判決は――死刑。|#0206Trial02_Yuki008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"直ちに刑を執行します。<br><link=\"Objection_02_06_02_03\">反論</link>は受け付けません。|#0206Trial02_Yuki009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

